{'symbol': 'PCG', 'date': '2021-11-01 08:12:00', 'title': 'PG&E CORPORATION REPORTS THIRD-QUARTER 2021 FINANCIAL RESULTS', 'text': 'SAN FRANCISCO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--PG&E CORPORATION (NYSE: PCG) RECORDED THIRD-QUARTER 2021 LOSSES ATTRIBUTABLE TO COMMON SHAREHOLDERS OF $1,091 MILLION, OR $0.55 PER SHARE, AS REPORTED IN ACCORDANCE WITH GENERALLY ACCEPTED ACCOUNTING PRINCIPLES (GAAP). THIS COMPARES WITH INCOME AVAILABLE FOR COMMON SHAREHOLDERS OF $83 MILLION, OR $0.04 PER SHARE, FOR THE THIRD QUARTER OF 2020. GAAP RESULTS INCLUDE NON-CORE ITEMS THAT MANAGEMENT DOES NOT CONSIDER REPRESENTATIVE OF ONGOING EARNINGS, WHICH TOTAL'}